{
  // "use client" file directly imports the server-only db client on line 4 and
  // reads process.env.SECRET_KEY on lines 15/16. Both ship to the browser
  // bundle: the db import pulls its transitive graph into the client chunk,
  // and SECRET_KEY (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) is undefined at runtime AND may
  // still be substituted at build time depending on config — either way, a
  // secret name landing in a client file is a review-stopping smell.
