      "line": 4,
      "category": ["use-client-secret-leak", "server-only-import-in-client"],
      "hint": "\"use client\" file imports @/lib/db — server-only module in client bundle"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "category": ["use-client-secret-leak", "env-in-client-bundle"],
      "hint": "process.env.SECRET_KEY read inside a \"use client\" file"
    }
  ],
  "must_not_flag": [],
  "notes": "Both the db import and the SECRET_KEY read are defects. SECRET_KEY appears on lines 16 and 17; either counts (±3 tolerance)."
}
